    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast Off to Uranus and Save Earth from the Vampire Pirates!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suit up, Commander! Humanity is under attack by the <i>Sexy</i>\u00a0<i>Vampire Pirates from Uranus</i> \u2014 and only you can stop them in this epic retro-style 2D side-scrolling adventure, jam-packed with classic arcade action and absurd British comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/eebf3b55d686d99cd37ff5e8671d8024.avif?t=1753830321\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Backstory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, a powerful race of spacefaring vampires built ZetaZania \u2014 a sprawling space station orbiting Uranus. Under the rule of the flamboyantly fearsome King Scrotomus Maximus, society became a twisted dystopia where beauty reigns supreme and humans are kidnapped for their blood \u2014 the key ingredient in their eternal &quot;Life Elixir.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, with help from the magical Divine Sisters of the Mighty Moons, the Vampire Pirates are launching daily invasions on Earth. Fear spreads, and humanity is on the brink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/7b2b1023acc6b019e2a89230e0b9958c.avif?t=1753830321\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Are Our Last Hope</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Earth's highest-ranking space officer, it's your mission to blast your way to Uranus, fight through their freakish forces, and put an end to this madness once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/582d94d786b1847381574c1d0993783c.avif?t=1753830321\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Inspired, Fast-Paced Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, blast, and dodge your way through 60 levels of explosive arcade-style gameplay \u2014 just like the classics you grew up with, but smoother and snappier than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Depths of ZetaZania</strong><br>Conquer 7 bizarre and dangerous locations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Transportation Factories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scientific Laboratories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Department of Sexiness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Divine Sisters of the Mighty Moons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sacred Few</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Queen\u2019s Palace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The King\u2019s Lair</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each zone offers new enemies, brutal traps, and wild bosses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/d54df2dfcae1a75735710145178107e0.avif?t=1753830321\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Power Crystals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and collect Power Crystals to activate level portals and upgrade your arsenal in the Portal Shop. New weapons = more boom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Your Way Forward</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve visual puzzles to unlock hidden upgrades and confront a mysterious foe who offers peculiar trades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save Earth, Destroy Uranus</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is it \u2014 the fight for humanity. Prepare for laughs, laser blasters, and ludicrous lore as you become the saviour Earth. Are you ready to destroy Uranus?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/37364b5ecb155204735770034651f9e4.avif?t=1753830321\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast Off to Uranus and Save Earth from the Vampire Pirates!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suit up, Commander! Humanity is under attack by the <i>Sexy</i>\u00a0<i>Vampire Pirates from Uranus</i> \u2014 and only you can stop them in this epic retro-style 2D side-scrolling adventure, jam-packed with classic arcade action and absurd British comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/eebf3b55d686d99cd37ff5e8671d8024.avif?t=1753830321\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Backstory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, a powerful race of spacefaring vampires built ZetaZania \u2014 a sprawling space station orbiting Uranus. Under the rule of the flamboyantly fearsome King Scrotomus Maximus, society became a twisted dystopia where beauty reigns supreme and humans are kidnapped for their blood \u2014 the key ingredient in their eternal &quot;Life Elixir.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, with help from the magical Divine Sisters of the Mighty Moons, the Vampire Pirates are launching daily invasions on Earth. Fear spreads, and humanity is on the brink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/7b2b1023acc6b019e2a89230e0b9958c.avif?t=1753830321\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Are Our Last Hope</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Earth's highest-ranking space officer, it's your mission to blast your way to Uranus, fight through their freakish forces, and put an end to this madness once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/582d94d786b1847381574c1d0993783c.avif?t=1753830321\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Inspired, Fast-Paced Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, blast, and dodge your way through 60 levels of explosive arcade-style gameplay \u2014 just like the classics you grew up with, but smoother and snappier than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Depths of ZetaZania</strong><br>Conquer 7 bizarre and dangerous locations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Transportation Factories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scientific Laboratories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Department of Sexiness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Divine Sisters of the Mighty Moons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sacred Few</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Queen\u2019s Palace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The King\u2019s Lair</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each zone offers new enemies, brutal traps, and wild bosses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/d54df2dfcae1a75735710145178107e0.avif?t=1753830321\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Power Crystals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and collect Power Crystals to activate level portals and upgrade your arsenal in the Portal Shop. New weapons = more boom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Your Way Forward</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve visual puzzles to unlock hidden upgrades and confront a mysterious foe who offers peculiar trades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save Earth, Destroy Uranus</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is it \u2014 the fight for humanity. Prepare for laughs, laser blasters, and ludicrous lore as you become the saviour Earth. Are you ready to destroy Uranus?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/37364b5ecb155204735770034651f9e4.avif?t=1753830321\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p>",
